~ shared/schema.wit — vocabulary definitions, available to every file
~ that references this one.

~ a chapter wrapper: the header renders from captures, the prose
~ flows through the ... body slot.

#chapter ||number, title||
@h2 ::number:: — ::title:: h2@
...
chapter#

~ an epigraph: body flows through ..., the source is attributed below.

#epigraph ||source||
@blockquote
...
— ::source::
blockquote@
epigraph#

~ a citation template, so every source renders in one consistent style.

#cite ||author, title, year, publisher||
::author:: (::year::). _::title::_. ::publisher::.
cite#
